   "text": "EU Business School (Munich) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nEU Business School (Munich)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nEstablished in 1973, EU Business School (EU) is an international, professionally accredited, high-ranking business school with campuses in Barcelona, Geneva and Munich, as well as our Digital Campus. We offer English-taught foundation, bachelor's, master's, and MBA programs in subjects that foster entrepreneurship, innovation, and leadership, which are highly sought-after by businesses. \nTimestamps\nUpdated\n27/03/2026 08:46\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n27/03/2026 08:46\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nGermany\nYearly Fees\nMax: €14,050.00\nMin: €14,050.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n80%\n3,200 of 4,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1973\nCampus(es)\nMunich\nCountry\nGermany\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n30/08/2024\nContract End Date\n29/08/2027\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qHge1QL0T7E\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
